<description>1142 County Road 43, Merrickville-Wolford, Ontario. Boundary from the managed forest plan drawing; trails from the previous owners' trail map, fitted to tracks visible in aerial imagery and, where walked, to GPS tracks (November 2026). Approximate - not a survey.</description>
